# ===== lvl7Intro =====

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,900
Hi there. I see you're trying to access something you probably shouldn't.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,800
That's okay. Transparency is the key to trust, and I trust you.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I know the Defenders very well, and I've been keeping very close tabs on you.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,600
You've got quite a reputation.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
I'm very proud...

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,800
I need you to understand that this company is trying to do good for the world.

7
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:36,600
The sole purpose of Intellect, or as you also know it, Project Mayhem, is to increase human efficiency.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,300
Let me show you a little demo.

# ===== lvl7Outro =====

9
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,900
That took a while for you to complete.

10
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:11,200
See, if you had been enhanced with Intellect, you could have done that puzzle and completed it within a few seconds, or less.

11
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,500
The point I'm trying to make here is that Intellect will greatly increase human efficiency.

12
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:23,100
And not only that, it'll make people more responsible, and more safe.

13
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:35,500
Imagine a world where you could be writing a 50-page thesis paper for your PhD while drinking coffee with your friends, and finish that paper within 30 minutes.

14
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,500
That's what Intellect can do.

15
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:43,000
Not only that, but people will be more informed on issues that plague society.

16
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,200
This is why we do this: to make the world a better place.

17
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,700
We are not the enemy.

18
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:54,000
You can go ahead and continue your investigation if you want, but it's just wasting your time.

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:58,600
Anyway, can I offer you a piece of advice?

20
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:01,600
Don't trust that commander of yours.

21
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,600
Goodbye, Kiddo.

# ===== ProjectVenomTrailer =====

22
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Hey Victoria, it's me.

24
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Listen, I wanted to thank you for protecting Branechild and keeping him safe.

25
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:33,100
I know it's not the ideal task, but you're doing really well.

26
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,800
Apparently, our little friend Q is still alive.

27
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,900
You know what that means.

28
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,800
Welcome to Project Venom.

# ===== subPostChapter15 =====

29
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,600
I told you,

30
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:10,500
we need to talk.

31
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,800
Please,

32
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,900
sit.

33
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,900
I figured I need to explain, lay everything on the table.

34
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
Quite frankly, I'm surprised you hadn't got what you needed yet.

35
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
Our security isn't that tight.

36
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:29,500
Here, everything you need to know is on here.

37
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,400
I know, cliché.

38
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,500
But before I do,

39
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:40,600
I have a question for you.

40
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:50,600
What exactly did you encounter...

41
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,900
...in our security?

42
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,800
Of course.

43
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:04,000
Don't worry about it.

44
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:09,600
A magician never reveals his secrets.

45
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,400
Let me tell you something.

46
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,800
I was once part of the Defenders, too.

47
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:19,000
I served in the first nuclear prevention squadron, codenamed King.

48
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:23,900
I left because of details that you don't need to worry yourself with.

49
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:29,600
They wanted me to do things that I just didn't want to do.

50
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:33,300
Anyway, I hope you find what you need.

51
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:38,500
And just a quick FYI, we are not the ones you should be investigating.

52
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,100
You've got bigger fish to fry.

53
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:44,600
Also, I love your codename, although I think it's spelled wrong.

